#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: baseCss()"
msgstr "# Função: baseCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-warning pantoken-doc-tag\">Beta</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-warning pantoken-doc-tag\">Beta</span>"

#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the opt-in base/reset stylesheet: global document defaults from the tokens (box-sizing, body\nreset, page surface, base text colour/font, `color-scheme`, base link), followed by the focus-ring\nrules (a document-level default that targets bare focusables). Only the ring *rules* live here — the\n`--instui-focus-outline-*` custom properties they read ship in the token sheet (`@pantoken/css`), so\n`base.css` no longer redefines them. Load it once, ahead of the component and prose sheets, when\npantoken owns the page."
msgstr "Compilar a folha de estilos base opcional/redefinida: padrões globais do documento a partir dos tokens (box-sizing, reset do body\n(superfície da página, cor/fonte base do texto, `color-scheme`, link base)), seguido pelas regras do focus-ring\n(um padrão a nível de documento que mira elementos focusáveis sem estilo). Apenas as *regras* do ring vivem aqui — as\npropriedades customizadas `--instui-focus-outline-*` que elas leem são fornecidas na folha de tokens (`@pantoken/css`), portanto\n`base.css` não as redefine mais. Carregue-a uma vez, antes das folhas de componentes e de prosa, quando\npantoken for responsável pela página."

#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS string."
msgstr "A string CSS."

#: formats/components/src/functions/componentsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: componentsCss()"
msgstr "# Função: componentsCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/componentsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the aggregated component stylesheet: every component's rules in the `COMPONENTS` concat order.\nThe size-alias and alias twins are appended PER COMPONENT (within its own chunk) so each alias\ndocuments on its own page — the aliases are discovered from each record's `@alias {@link -x}` or\n`@deprecated {@link -x}` metadata (see `withAliases`), not a central hand-kept list. The\n`--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale the components reference is defined in the token sheet\n(`@pantoken/css`), so it's no longer inlined here."
msgstr "Construa a folha de estilo agregada do componente: as regras de cada componente na ordem de concatenação `COMPONENTS`.\nOs aliases de tamanho e aliases gêmeos são anexados POR COMPONENTE (dentro de seu próprio chunk) para que cada alias\nse documente em sua própria página — os aliases são descobertos a partir do `@alias {@link -x}` ou\nmetadado `@deprecated {@link -x}` de cada registro (veja `withAliases`), não de uma lista central mantida manualmente.\nA referência de escala de sombra `--instui-elevation-*` que os componentes usam é definida na folha de tokens\n(`@pantoken/css`), portanto ela não é mais embutida aqui."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: elevationCss()"
msgstr "# Função: elevationCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the elevation token block: `<selector> { --instui-elevation-*: … }`. Shipped inside\n`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), and reusable by other\nlayered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."
msgstr "Build the elevation token block: `&lt;selector&gt; { --instui-elevation-*: … }`. Shipped inside\n`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), and reusable by other\nlayered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`selector` — the rule selector (default `:root`)."
msgstr "`selector` — o seletor de regra (padrão `:root`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### selector?"
msgstr "#### selector?"

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: elevationDeclarations()"
msgstr "# Função: elevationDeclarations()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `--instui-elevation-*` name/value pairs (each a multi-layer `box-shadow`). Values reference the\nthemed drop-shadow colour tokens, so they adapt per theme wherever a token sheet is loaded."
msgstr "Os pares nome/valor `--instui-elevation-*` (cada um um `box-shadow` de múltiplas camadas). Os valores referenciam os tokens de cor themed de drop-shadow, portanto se adaptam por tema sempre que uma folha de tokens for carregada."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One `[customProperty, value]` pair per level and alias."
msgstr "Um par `[customProperty, value]` por nível e alias."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: focusOutlineCss()"
msgstr "# Função: focusOutlineCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the focus-outline block: the `--instui-focus-outline-*` token defs plus the ring rules.\nBaked into `base.css` (so focusables get the ring out of the box), and reusable by other layered\noutputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector`/`tokenSelector` options."
msgstr "Construir o bloco focus-outline: as definições de token `--instui-focus-outline-*` mais as regras do ring.\nIncorporado em `base.css` (assim os elementos focáveis recebem o ring pronto), e reutilizável por outras saídas em camadas\n(ex.: o renderer Pendo) via as opções `selector`/`tokenSelector`."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`selector` — the focusable selector; `tokenSelector` — where the token defs land\n  (default `:where(:root)`)."
msgstr "`selector` — o seletor focável; `tokenSelector` — onde as definições de token são colocadas\n  (padrão `:where(:root)`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### tokenSelector?"
msgstr "#### tokenSelector?"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: focusOutlineDeclarations()"
msgstr "# Função: focusOutlineDeclarations()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `--instui-focus-outline-*` name/value pairs the ring rules read. Colour/width/offset reference\nthe themed shared focus tokens; the transition, line style, and inset are constants."
msgstr "Os pares nome/valor `--instui-focus-outline-*` que as regras do anel leem. Cor/largura/deslocamento referenciam\nios tokens de foco compartilhados com tema; a transição, o estilo da linha e o recuo são constantes."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One `[customProperty, value]` pair per focus-ring variable."
msgstr "Um par `[customProperty, value]` por variável do anel de foco."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: focusOutlineRules()"
msgstr "# Função: focusOutlineRules()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The focus-ring rules for a given focusable selector: a transparent resting ring that transitions in\non `:focus-visible`, plus the `-focus-color-*` / `-focus-position-inset` / `-focus-within` /\n`-without-focus-animation` modifiers. All `:where()`-wrapped, so zero-specificity."
msgstr "As regras do anel de foco para um seletor focável específico: um anel de repouso transparente que transiciona em\nem `:focus-visible`, além dos modificadores `-focus-color-*` / `-focus-position-inset` / `-focus-within` /\n`-without-focus-animation`. Todos encapsulados em `:where()`, portanto especificidade zero."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### selector?"
msgstr "### selector?"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The focusable selector the base ring applies to (default [FOCUSABLE\\_SELECTOR](../variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md))."
msgstr "O seletor focável ao qual o anel base se aplica (padrão [FOCUSABLE\\_SELECTOR](../variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md))."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS rules string."
msgstr "A string de regras CSS."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
