#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — `theme.css`/`theme.js` prontos para upload para o Theme\nEditor do Canvas LMS, pré-configurados com o CSS hospedado no CDN do pantoken. Consumido pela plataforma `canvas-theme-editor` de `@pantoken/scaffold`; também utilizável de forma independente."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` são a saída padrão do jsDelivr, sem versionamento — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) para\napontar a outro provedor de CDN, fixar uma versão ou trocar por outros assets do pantoken/terceiros."

